<title>USA: Geraghty &amp; Miller consolidate offices.</title>
<headline>Geraghty &amp; Miller consolidate offices.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHELLE PARK, N.J. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Geraghty &amp; Miller Inc said Tuesday it had consolidated its Albany, N.Y., Melville, N.Y., Rochelle Park, N.J., and Langhorne, Pa., offices into one operating unit.</p>
<p>The new set-up is structured to more efficiently provide environmental and infrastructure engineering services to clients in the Tri-State region.</p>
<p>The firm is one of the Heidemij group of companies, a global environmental and infrastructure firm based in the Netherlands.</p>
</text>
